If your audience only follows you for useful content, you're easier to replace than you think.

@thechrisdo says most creators are serviceable but forgettable. The ones people stay loyal to lean into what makes them different.

Search "Nathan Barry Show" to watch the full episode.

If your audience can't sum up what you stand for in a few words, your personal brand isn't strong enough.

@thechrisdo says every personal brand needs three things: a cause, an enemy, and a rallying cry that ties them together.

Search "Nathan Barry Show" to watch the full episode.

